# Template for defaults/instructions.txt
#
# Replace this entire file with the system prompt / model instructions you want
# the assistant to use by default. This text is loaded into the "Model
# instructions" field on the frontend when the page loads (see /api/config in
# app.py).
#
# Notes:
# - Plain text only; the whole file content is sent as the system prompt.
# - Lines starting with "#" are NOT stripped — remove this comment block before
#   use, or `setup.sh` will copy it verbatim into defaults/instructions.txt.
# - Keep it focused: describe the role, tone, task, constraints, and any
#   structured outline the assistant should follow.
#
